# Figma (MVDS)

## MCP

Cursor: Figma plugin / MCP (`plugin-figma-figma`). Before `use_figma`, load the figma-use skill. MVDS-specific sync skills live under `.claude/skills/mvds-figma-*` — **run only when the founder explicitly asks** (AGENTS.md / docs/SYNC.md).

## Source of truth

**Code is law.** MVDS Core (`fileKey C20nU0mROzk3Zr0I9BELJF`) is a generated, one-way mirror (code → Figma). Scratch/prototype frames for OpenSpec iteration are allowed in `design.md`; do not treat Figma as upstream for tokens or component APIs.

## Map to MVDS — not hub kits

- Tokens: `src/index.css` / Tailwind `@theme` (`bg-background`, `text-h1`, 8-grid spacing, etc.)
- Layout: `Stack` / `Inline` / `Grid` / `Container` — never raw flex/grid utilities for page layout
- Components: `src/components/ui/`, `layout/`, `site/`, `blocks/`
- Treat Figma MCP export as **reference**; rewrite to MVDS primitives and tokens

## Proposal file page naming (scratch / explore files)

When iterating UI in a Figma design file (not MVDS Core library sync), use **one page per step**. Never overwrite a prior page — create a new page for each proposal iteration.

| Page name | Role |
|---|---|
| `0.0 As is` | **First page.** Map the current product/surface faithfully (what ships today). No proposed IA. |
| `01.0 Propose: <openspec-change>` | First proposal for OpenSpec change `<openspec-change>` (kebab-case slug). |
| `02.0 Propose: <openspec-change> update` | Next iteration (then `03.0` …). Append ` update` (and bump the numeric prefix). |

Rules:

- Always create `0.0 As is` before any `Propose:` page.
- Page names carry the **OpenSpec change slug** after `Propose:` so design.md and Figma stay aligned.
- Leave prior pages untouched when direction changes — new page, new number.

## OpenSpec `design.md`

For `openspec/changes/<id>/design.md`, every UI change MUST include a **Visual design / Figma** table:

- Primary Figma file URL (MVDS Core and/or scratch)
- **Pages in scope** (e.g. `0.0 As is`, `01.0 Propose: storybook-start-here`)
- Frames/components in scope
- Libraries (MVDS Core Tokens/Scales/components)
- Breakpoints (S=480 / L=1024 unless Storybook-only)
- Status (draft / iterating / ready for apply)

API-only: one "N/A — no UI" row with rationale.

## Code Connect

MVDS does **not** use Code Connect (AGENTS.md). Do not add `.figma.ts` connect files unless the founder changes that policy.
